  "title_ja": "外国人担当職員の復帰",
  "summary": "This memo details the planned return of several individuals (AAC-1130 through AAC-1148, excluding AAC-1142 and AAC-1143) to the U.S. around December 5, 1964, via an Agency C-118 aircraft. It outlines coordination with Customs and I&NS regarding the arrival and transfer of the individuals and the cargo on board.",
